(7700249, 1263685, 67145, '<td valign="top">WOW .. this is such an amazing pic .. the building aint half bad either . !! .. <br/>i''m assuming wide angle has helped the distortion .. ?? .. correct me if i''m wrong .. <br/>but if not wide angle this building is one in a million .. <br/>looking again maybe its a combination of a crazy leaning building and wide angle .. <br/>thats me for trying to work this out . lol .. ;)<br/>loving this for the challenge .. and congrats on the ribbon .. :)</td>', 'WOW .. this is such an amazing pic .. the building aint half bad either . !! .. i''m assuming wide angle has helped the distortion .. ?? .. correct me if i''m wrong .. but if not wide angle this building is one in a million .. looking again maybe its a combination of a crazy leaning building and wide angle .. thats me for trying to work this out . lol .. ;)loving this for the challenge .. and congrats on the ribbon .. :)', '2021-09-03 04:18:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7700250, 1263569, 67145, '<td valign="top">such a cool photo .. <br/>often taking a photo of a bird in a tree from below .. it can look like its taken almost straight on .. <br/>but knowing you i''d say you have totally satisfied the challenge requirements .... not just the looking upward bit but the angled .. like, look at that wing ... angled for sure . <br/>great to see this on the front page and congratulations on the fourth place . :)</td>', 'such a cool photo .. often taking a photo of a bird in a tree from below .. it can look like its taken almost straight on .. but knowing you i''d say you have totally satisfied the challenge requirements .... not just the looking upward bit but the angled .. like, look at that wing ... angled for sure . great to see this on the front page and congratulations on the fourth place . :)', '2021-09-03 04:22:25.000000', NULL, 0),
