(7700285, 1263786, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot Lydia. Its too bad you didnt have more time to work on it and bring out the highlights. Everything else about it is really good. What I like is the fact that you make all the important parts of the picture dominant in the composition. It very precisely tells a story and of course I love the dog! He really looks like he is enjoying the ride.</td>', 'I really like this shot Lydia. Its too bad you didnt have more time to work on it and bring out the highlights. Everything else about it is really good. What I like is the fact that you make all the important parts of the picture dominant in the composition. It very precisely tells a story and of course I love the dog! He really looks like he is enjoying the ride.', '2021-09-03 07:01:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7700287, 1263797, 3306, '<td valign="top">An amazing sky. I kind of wish you had cropped the composition just above the lights of the cabin and darkened out the roofline. It would make me feel like I was lying on the ground all alone on a warm summer night gazing upon the universe! Excellent first attempt at astrophotography.</td>', 'An amazing sky. I kind of wish you had cropped the composition just above the lights of the cabin and darkened out the roofline. It would make me feel like I was lying on the ground all alone on a warm summer night gazing upon the universe! Excellent first attempt at astrophotography.', '2021-09-03 07:07:42.000000', NULL, 0),
