(7700565, 1263785, 8759, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments. <br/> <br/>It is taken from a pool pointing the <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/camera.php?CAMERA_ID=2561" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">GoPro</a> up and angled. I aimed to get the surface of the water halfway the lens but given the small size of the lens it is very hard to get that half on surface half underwater images. There are actually <a href="https://youtu.be/7WLMYHiNzvI" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">special domes</a> for that. I was pleased with the result as it became more abstract.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments.  It is taken from a pool pointing the GoPro up and angled. I aimed to get the surface of the water halfway the lens but given the small size of the lens it is very hard to get that half on surface half underwater images. There are actually special domes for that. I was pleased with the result as it became more abstract.', '2021-09-06 01:32:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7700588, 1263685, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great photo. What an interesting building.</td>', 'Great photo. What an interesting building.', '2021-09-06 13:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
